 # User Flow Tree
 
+## Engineering20 durable bottle transcription (local implementation, unaccepted)
+
+Critical, repeatable Expo-web branches at 375x667 and 430x932: explicit adult/health-consent entry -> manual bottle -> Bottle & formula history -> Record label observation -> type unconfirmed text -> Save bottle draft on this device -> confirmed encrypted readback -> navigation/reload -> explicit Resume saved bottle draft -> Review current saved bottle -> Keep draft with reviewed source -> explicit Confirm this bottle observation. Unsaved later edits are not claimed durable. Resume/review alone creates no observation, use or inferred formula.
+
+Back during editing offers Keep editing, Save bottle draft and leave, or exact-revision discard. Failed save/removal shows a content-free refusal and retains uncertainty. A replaced source requires another explicit review; missing products cannot receive an observation. Shelf -> Saved bottle drafts lists retained unconfirmed drafts, including removed bottles, and offers review/cancel/confirm discard. Empty inventory is distinct from unreadable/unsupported/key/authority failure. Full export includes strictly decoded owner-bound drafts; withdrawal and full deletion own their registered key.
+
+Current adult receipt, health-consent contract and persisted owner/lifecycle epoch are authenticated before private draft reads and rechecked inside reserved mutations. Fresh runtime leases may resume the same persisted epoch; actual regrant epochs do not inherit older drafts. Stale save, review, discard and cleanup callbacks cannot mutate successor revisions. Confirmation reserves the exact saved draft while appending Shelf history; draft retirement is separate and may remain unconfirmed after interruption. Matching facts never automatically accept transcription.
+
+Web startup admits one application runtime per origin with a document-lifetime exclusive Web Lock before private providers and recovery startup. A second tab shows refusal/retry; closing the first permits explicit retry. Missing lock support refuses private startup. Visibility and navigation do not release ownership. Browser verification includes second-tab refusal, takeover, reload, keyboard/focus, 48px controls, and zero horizontal overflow. Native single-runtime durability, physical keys/crashes and VoiceOver remain unqualified. All38/all18 UNACCEPTED; release NO_GO.
+
 ## Engineering17 explicit applied-routine clearing and original-record consistency
 
 Appointment brief selection → Review starts at the top with a semantic review heading and opening text visible → Edit returns to selection with chosen records/questions intact → reopen starts at the top again. The scroller alone remounts; authority, reviewed content, photo readiness and cleanup state retain their existing parent lifecycle. Keyboard stays in the existing modal.
@@ -3208,3 +3218,10 @@ You -> Delete account / Withdraw health-data consent -> exact rendered confirmat
